# Demo target repos -- each is its own standalone git repo pushed to GitHub
# separately (the swarm clones them by URL, e.g. https://github.com/shob0902/demo_repo),
# not content of this project. Tracking them here records a submodule pointer with
# no .gitmodules, which breaks clones that check out submodules (e.g. Netlify).
demo_repo/
demo_repo_broken/
